Z||000009||rogergarrison||11-27-2001||10:37 PM||||Lisas been away from her puter for a while since before thanksgiving, dont know when shell be back, her driver is broke.<P>I own a body shop, been doing paint and body work for 30 years. There mostly full of BS. The Fiero is no different than painting any other car, all the same materials. Body damage repair is a little different, but not rocket science. You just repair it like its a flexible bumper. If there telling you all these special steps run away. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_bs.gif"><P>------------------<BR>           <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/rogergarrison1.gif"> ||||reg||1
